.TH SETRLIMIT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setrlimit \- sets the process resource limits; increasing hard limits requires privileges
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/resource.h>
.B int setrlimit(int resource, const struct rlimit* limits);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets the process resource limits; increasing hard limits requires privileges.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setrlimit (2)
